⚡️⚡️🇺🇸🇮🇱 The U.S Senate fails to pass the National Defense Authorization Act for FY-2027; which includes controversial legislation to ‘merge’ the Israeli Defense Force into the United States Armed Forces.

The U.S Senate failed the vote, with 50 Nays (50 said no), 46 Yays (46 said yes), and 4 Abstains/Non-votes.

